# A card exiled face down has no characteristics (CR 406.3a), so it is no creature card to Huskburster Swarm's cost. On turn 2
# Bot2 exiles Bot1's Ornithopter face up with Swords to Plowshares and, with Outrageous Robbery (X = 2), the top two cards
# of Bot1's library, two more Ornithopters, face down. Only the face-up one reduces the cost: {7}{B}. With 5 mana (Mox Jet
# into Dark Ritual makes BBB, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl) the Swarm is refused (it would cost {5}{B} if the face-down cards counted);
# with Mox Sapphire and Mox Emerald it has 7 and is cast (it would cost {8} if the face-up one did not count either).

